{"identity":{"original_title":"Beat Slayer","developers":["ByteRockers' Games"],"publishers":["ByteRockers' Games","Paras Games"],"release_status":"released","release_date":"2024-04-04","tags":["轻度Rogue","动作","冒险","砍杀","机器人"]},"hooks":[{"text":"每一次移动和攻击都必须踩准音乐节拍，乱按按钮会直接受到惩罚","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Every move you make has to match the rhythm of the soundtrack. Fail to do so and you’ll pay the price. No button mashing, no frantic inputs.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2089830/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"数秒内要决定冲刺进退、积攒Drive、扩散状态或把敌人踢向墙壁和同伴","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Dash to engage or disengage? Attack to build up your drive bar or spread your status effects? Kick your enemies against walls or into each other? The choice is yours!","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2089830/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"每局由风险偏好、起始武器、所选升级与不断扩展的技能共同塑形","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Each run plays differently and is influenced by your playstyle and your thrill for risks, but also by your starting weapon, your chosen upgrades and your growing skill set.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2089830/","label":"证据原文片段"}],"opinions":[{"text":"音乐曲目数量有限。","dimension":"音频","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"需留意","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"the music is great (but limited)","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/Yasashiimi/recommended/2089830/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"战斗系统显得浅薄。","dimension":"玩法","source":"鉴赏家观点","polarity":"需留意","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"the combat is shallow","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/Synikx/recommended/2089830?snr=1_5_9__402","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"节拍机制对实际游玩的影响过弱。","dimension":"玩法","source":"鉴赏家观点","polarity":"需留意","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"staying on beat barely matters","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/Synikx/recommended/2089830?snr=1_5_9__402","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"节奏与轻度肉鸽动作的结合带来令人亢奋的战斗体验。","dimension":"玩法","source":"鉴赏家观点","polarity":"喜欢","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"offering a head-banging blend of rhythm and roguelite action that pumped us with adrenaline","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/44145907-The-Last-Curator/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"游戏循环容易让人沉迷。","dimension":"玩法","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"喜欢","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"Addictive game loop","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197969370858/recommended/2089830/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"操作响应灵敏，手感良好。","dimension":"玩法","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"喜欢","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"The gameplay is very responsive and feels good","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/Yasashiimi/recommended/2089830/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"故事足以支撑游玩过程。","dimension":"剧情","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"喜欢","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"the story is enough to get you by","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/Yasashiimi/recommended/2089830/","label":"证据原文片段"}]}],"metrics":[{"id":"sales","label":"销量","value":2582,"unit":"份","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"wishlist","label":"愿望单","value":40670,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"followers","label":"关注人数","value":2259,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"revenue","label":"收入估算","value":39281,"unit":"USD","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"players","label":"玩家数","value":3451,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"owners","label":"拥有者估算","value":3451,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"playtime","label":"平均游玩时长","value":4.756208386567498,"unit":"小时","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"reviews","label":"Steam 评论数","value":125,"unit":"条","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"score","label":"评分","value":93,"unit":"分","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"positive","label":"Steam 好评率","value":92.8,"unit":"%","state":"available","date":"2026-07-24"}],"baseline":{"date":"2026-07-23","message":"首期基线，暂无可比趋势。"},"risks":["音乐曲目数量有限。","战斗系统显得浅薄。","节拍机制对实际游玩的影响过弱。"],"actions":[{"label":"降低优先级观察","target":"复核负向体验与Steam口碑是否持续","reason":"当前存在具体负向玩家证据或明确客观口碑风险。","trigger":"